[statement]
A triggered package is walked at the first of the names it carries and
provides in the order of apk's table: `z`, in bucket 18,392, provides
`w`, in bucket 80, and is walked before `c` (7,966) and `a` (12,779).

[repository]
P:base
V:1

P:a
V:1
i:base

P:c
V:1
i:base

P:z
V:1
i:base
p:w

[request]
base

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install base 1
install z 1
install c 1
install a 1
